<Layout title="Meet Foggy Layers">
 <section class="page-intro"><div class="container"><p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Our story</span></p><p class="eyebrow kicker">Hello from Foggy Layers</p><h1>A little imagination.<br/>A whole lot of layers.</h1><p class="lede">Printed characters, custom projects, and the fun of turning an idea into something you can hold.</p></div></section>
 <section class="container section about-grid"><div><h2>Meet Bradley Scherer.</h2><p>Bradley is the person behind Foggy Layers. This is a place for ready-made printed pieces and the ideas you'd like to bring to life.</p><p>You can browse the collection, send a model for printing, or start a conversation about a design. We'll review custom projects with you and agree on the details before work begins.</p><p>Shipping and local pickup in Everett, Washington are available.</p><a class="text-link" href="/project/">Say hello with an idea <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div><div class="about-photos about-photos--single"><img src="/images/packaged-characters.jpeg" alt="Character figures packaged with Foggy Layers business cards" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="2048"/></div></section>
 <section class="wide-cta"><div class="container"><div><h2>Find your kind of curious.</h2><p>Take a closer look at the printed collection.</p></div><a class="button button-light" href="/shop/">Meet the prints <Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></div></section>
</Layout>
